    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "A room has a length 8 m shorter than its width and a perimeter of 80 m. Find the length and width of the room.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Length $16\\text{ m}$; width $24\\text{ m}$.",
      "worked": "Let the width be $w$ metres. The length is $(w-8)$ metres.\n$$\\begin{align*}2w+2(w-8)&=80\\\\4w-16&=80\\\\4w&=96\\\\w&=24\\end{align*}$$\nThe length is $24-8=16\\text{ m}$ and the width is $24\\text{ m}$.",
